    {
      "day": 14,
      "line": "Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."
    },
    {
      "day": 14,
      "line": "The package sits in your pack, unopened. Opening it takes a day-part — the fans demand the full unboxing. (Use it from your pack when you have a morning to spend.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 16,
      "line": "The woods go silent — not quiet. Silent. Like the world holding its breath. The pack is already moving. They go quiet before the rush. If the birds stop, they're already moving."
    },
    {
      "day": 16,
      "line": "The lead staggers — and the pack's silence shatters into yips and snarls. Coordination broken. (WOUND THE LEAD: it worked.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 16,
      "line": "⚔️ Peyton killed the Paparazzo with their party — 3 rounds, 45 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."
